                <p class="section-label">What is Quickler?</p>
                <h2 id="what-is-title">Your team already does the inspections. Quickler does the paperwork.</h2>
                <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.7;">Most field teams already capture the job on their phone &mdash; a few WhatsApp messages, a photo, a voice note. The problem is what happens next: someone has to write it up into a proper report, certificate or compliance record. That is the bit Quickler removes.</p>
                <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.7;margin-top:0.8rem;">A worker answers Quickler's questions in WhatsApp on site. Quickler turns those replies and photos into a clean, timestamped digital record automatically, flags any faults, and produces a PDF whenever a client or regulator needs one. No app to install, no per-user licence, no end-of-day desk work.</p>
                <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.7;margin-top:0.8rem;"><strong>Who it is for:</strong> field teams, inspectors, surveyors, maintenance and compliance teams &mdash; any firm with a repeatable check or report that still gets written up by hand afterwards.</p>
