            <h2 id="use-cases-title" style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.2rem;">Field compliance reporting for UK and global trades</h2>
            <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.7;max-width:720px;">Quickler is a <strong>WhatsApp inspection app</strong> for field teams anywhere. Engineers use WhatsApp — which is already on their phones — to complete compliance checks on site. Quickler collects the responses and produces a clean, structured digital record automatically, which exports to a PDF report whenever one is needed. There is no separate app to install and no per-user licence fee. Because it runs entirely over WhatsApp, <a href="/pages/global-field-compliance.html">Quickler works in any country</a> — it is used in the UK, Europe and the United States.</p>
            <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.7;max-width:720px;margin-top:0.8rem;">It covers <a href="/pages/eicr-software-uk.html">EICR electrical inspection reports</a>, <a href="/pages/cp12-gas-safety-software-uk.html">CP12 gas safety certificates</a>, <a href="/pages/van-check-app-uk.html">daily van safety checks</a>, <a href="/pages/construction-site-inspection-report-uk.html">construction site inspection reports</a>, and any other field compliance workflow a firm repeats regularly. Firms switching from <a href="/pages/iauditor-alternative-uk.html">iAuditor or SafetyCulture</a> typically go live within a week.</p>
